3. PARITY (web ClimatePanel.tsx -> native), states, i18n
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources : useTranslation -> CabinClimateStrings (P1/S10) ;
               useUnits        -> CabinClimateUnitContext + pure SI temp converter/formatter
                                  (display-boundary only; DB/API stay SI per Phase-42).
Shared comps : @/components/ui (TSGlassPanel, TSCard, TSButton),
               @/components/data-display (TSMetricValue tiles),
               @/components/feedback (TSEmptyState, TSQueryError, TSSkeleton).
Charts/maps  : none (web source has none).
Sections     : Cabin + Outside temps (MetricCard), Driver/Passenger setpoint rows,
               HVAC State row, Fan Speed gauge (six ramp bars + value),
               Defrost / Climate / Precondition pills (flow-wrapped).
States (all render): loading (skeleton), loaded, empty ("No climate data available"),
               error (QueryError + retry), stale (chip + banner + auto-refresh),
               offline (cached value + offline chip/banner).
Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every tile/row/gauge/pill + a panel summary;
               Dynamic Type via tokenized fonts; Reduce Motion honored by TSFadeIn.
Telemetry    : view.opened emitted once with surface slug "ClimatePanel" (P1/S11).
i18n keys (web parity, in ClimatePanel.strings table "ClimatePanel"):
  common.climate, common.insideTemp, common.outsideTemp, telemetry.driverSetpoint,
  telemetry.passengerSetpoint, telemetry.hvacState, telemetry.fanSpeed,
  telemetry.defrost, telemetry.climate, telemetry.precondition, common.on, common.off,
